- Dernière vérification

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.467 line:53%
avant le départ.

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:13.866 line:53%
Il s'agit de s'assurer que

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:15.233 line:53%
la trousse de premiers soins

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:16.633 line:53%
est complète et fonctionnelle.

00:00:13.967 --> 00:00:18.000 line:53%
- TXA, that's your blood

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:18.033 line:53%
clotter. That's ketamine.

00:00:16.733 --> 00:00:19.400 line:53%
- Un outil essentiel

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:22.200 line:53%
pour les hospitaliers,

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.600 line:53%
le bataillon médical dont

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.967 line:53%
fait partie Brandon Mitchell.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.500 line:53%
Ancien militaire canadien,

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:28.033 line:53%
originaire du NouveaBrBrunswick,

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:44.033 line:53%
Brandon est, depuis un an,

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:44.033 line:53%
engagé volontaire au sein

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:44.033 line:53%
des forces ukrainiennes.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.700 line:53%
 En 12 mois, il a été

00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:50.233 line:53%
de toutes les batailles,

00:00:47.267 --> 00:01:04.833 line:53%
sur tous les fronts,

00:00:48.800 --> 00:01:04.833 line:53%
mais sans jamais

00:00:50.333 --> 00:01:04.833 line:53%
tuer qui que ce soit.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:27.833 line:53%
 Et s'il n'a jamais

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:27.833 line:53%
pris de vies, il estime

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:27.833 line:53%
en avoir sauvé quelques-unes.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.800 line:53%
 La guerre vient avec

00:01:29.233 --> 00:01:33.400 line:53%
son lot de risques; Brandon

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:35.233 line:53%
l'a rapidement compris.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:37.100 line:53%
Pour donner un sens

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:38.933 line:53%
à sa mission, il s'est mis

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:40.767 line:53%
à documenter son quotidien

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:42.600 line:53%
dans autant de vidéos

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:44.433 line:53%
devenues très populaires

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:46.267 line:53%
sur les réseaux sociaux.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:48.100 line:53%
- Get ready to get out.

00:01:44.533 --> 00:01:49.933 line:53%
- Yeah, we're...

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:51.367 line:53%
- And I'll turn around.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:52.500 line:53%
Go, go, go, go, go,

00:01:50.033 --> 00:02:00.100 line:53%
go, go, go, go, go!

00:01:51.467 --> 00:02:00.100 line:53%
I'll turn around.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:02:00.100 line:53%
Go, go, go, go!

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:07.866 line:53%
 Comme cette fois

00:02:08.033 --> 00:02:11.367 line:53%
 Comme cette fois

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:12.533 line:53%
où son véhicule

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:17.167 line:53%
a roulé sur une mine.

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:17.167 line:53%
(explosions)

00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:17.167 line:53%
(cri)

00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:20.667 line:53%
- Oh my God! My God!

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:21.833 line:53%
(bips de censure)

00:02:19.633 --> 00:02:33.500 line:53%
Oh my God!

00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:33.500 line:53%
I'm alive! I'm alive!

00:02:21.933 --> 00:02:33.500 line:53%
Get my med...

00:02:33.667 --> 00:02:37.033 line:53%
 Bilan : une commotion cérébrale

00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:38.200 line:53%
et une perte d'audition.

00:02:35.967 --> 00:02:51.567 line:53%
Maisalalgré le danger,

00:02:37.133 --> 00:02:51.567 line:53%
le Canadien est convaincu

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:51.567 line:53%
d'être à sa place en Ukraine.

00:02:51.733 --> 00:03:02.733 line:53%
 Aujourd'hui, Brandon

00:02:52.867 --> 00:03:02.733 line:53%
considère l'armée ukrainienne

00:02:54.033 --> 00:03:02.733 line:53%
mmmme sa deuxième famille.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:06.267 line:53%
 Surtout les hommes

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:07.433 line:53%
de la 28e brigade

00:03:05.233 --> 00:03:08.600 line:53%
du 3e bataillon mécanisé,

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:09.767 line:53%
à qui il rend régulièrement

00:03:07.533 --> 00:03:10.933 line:53%
visite dans leur bunker,

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:12.233 line:53%
10 mètres sous terre, à

00:03:09.866 --> 00:03:15.533 line:53%
proximité de la ligne de front.

00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:17.567 line:53%
Ses vidéos lui ont permis

00:03:12.333 --> 00:03:19.567 line:53%
d'amasser des fonds.

00:03:15.633 --> 00:03:21.600 line:53%
 Aussitôt utilisés pour

00:03:17.667 --> 00:04:01.433 line:53%
acheter des radios encptptés

00:03:19.667 --> 00:04:01.433 line:53%
et des génératrices pour

00:03:21.700 --> 00:04:01.433 line:53%
ses frères d'armes.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:05.233 line:53%
- Pablo Escobar...

00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:06.500 line:53%
(rires)

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:07.767 line:53%
- Aujourd'hui, partout où il va,

00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:09.033 line:53%
Brandon se fait aborder

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:30.533 line:53%
dans la rue par des soldats

00:04:07.866 --> 00:04:30.533 line:53%
reconnaissants qui souhaitent

00:04:09.133 --> 00:04:30.533 line:53%
le remercier pour sa générosité.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:34.300 line:53%
 Parce qu'il a fait sienne

00:04:31.933 --> 00:04:35.567 line:53%
cette guerre, Brandon

00:04:33.167 --> 00:04:36.800 line:53%
n'imagine pas quitter

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:38.167 line:53%
l'Ukraine avant la victoire.

00:04:35.667 --> 00:04:39.600 line:53%
En espérant vivre asse

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:41.067 line:53%
longtemps et sans être

00:04:38.267 --> 00:04:42.967 line:53%
gravement blessé pour fêter

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:43.367 line:53%
avec ses compagnons d'armes

00:04:41.167 --> 00:04:43.367 line:53%
le jour de la libération.

